      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the adult man in <Picture 1>, a character reference sheet whose three panels show the same man: his face, his outfit from the front and his outfit from the back. He has dark side-swept hair and a full dark beard, and wears a grey collared knit pullover, dark charcoal pleated trousers and brown leather shoes. His exact facial structure, features and proportions stay identical to <Picture 1> in every frame.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video shows <Subject 1> seated at a desk in a dim study at night, in a three-panel split screen, as the camera performs a three-panel split screen.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - his face, identity and clothing are held identical to <Picture 1> in every frame with zero drift.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is live-action and cinematic, shot on an ARRI Alexa Mini with a 35mm prime, locked off, warm lamplight against a dark room, a muted palette.\n[Shot 1] <Subject 1> writes steadily and continuously throughout, his hand moving across the page, pausing once to read what he wrote before carrying on.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe steady scratch of a pen, close and continuous, over the low hum of a quiet room, with a chair creaking once.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA tight rhythmic pulse locked to the writing, a new layer entering each time another panel opens."
